The original Windows Discord Drover project is https://github.com/hdrover/discord-drover by hdrover. The Windows setup script downloads its published release from the upstream project at install time; this repository does not bundle, relicense, or claim ownership of that upstream binary or source code. Consult the upstream repository for its terms and release information.
